tachments": []}, {"id": "f440ed3e0ed4126238022c792d79d561", "ts": "1757491784.055019", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey what's up", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "809839c6cd4fd35d41d10487513051c1", "ts": "1757493832.456449", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I know we reduced the cut out cost to make the zombies quick. I wonder what's quickest way to change them up a bit, like say adding a necklace or accessory to change them up just a bit.", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "feb0328b401402584dd1420f9dd2e248", "ts": "1757493840.294259", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "What would be the time cost of such an effort", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "52aa5d2365718e668317cc2365c004a8", "ts": "1757493879.837339", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "we need to test to see if we can change stuff and what that does to the animation", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "808c8db6d98f3dba0177861a668699b3", "ts": "1757493880.949309", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Can you make an estimate and we can talk about it during the art meeting today?", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": "1757493880.949309", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1757494252.447539", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "831e53b56ac1a00a9eb550f3fb1b870a", "ts": "1757493890.903619", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "first of all we need to change levels on the boxer guy", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "9dd2e941c8aeb7d83c25f379137760ab", "ts": "1757493893.166079", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "its too dark", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "a0fc75d3af68044681b51076de5f1af1", "ts": "1757493933.174139", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "in the past i've seen that if we save the layer info . basically keep the layers intact and only marge down into them in photoshop. the rig data it's still saved", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "1b26e288a7e971908338988a90b88a56", "ts": "1757494001.922319", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "if we add stuff to them i dont know if that gets us in trouble with the rig we need to test", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "3996fcec6a5db005610f1988d78764a1", "ts": "1757494010.145309", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "technically we should be able to add stuff", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "86a3a2d030e3472909e5d9b9ffbdd3ae", "ts": "1757494012.053449", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "that was the idea", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "bfd0146afe85d9ff45ce0ada8a2674b3", "ts": "1757494075.815549", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "the problem it's that i'm pretty full with the work at the moment we need to beautyfiy the game, once i'm more clear with that i would defenetley want to adress the zombie situation", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "4c3b22e7e361814567127826d8712cc3", "ts": "1757494080.655399", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "or EVIN make new ones", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "61c04c6896f04caeed61f58c648196a7", "ts": "1757494088.221499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "i think most important will be bosses", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "9f8409acdc091c633817503bf67b122d", "ts": "1757494093.376159", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "i dont think we have bosses", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "511d32ed10a10ec786c0494433148d56", "ts": "1757494111.768549", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "for example the bike kid. we built all that infrastucture for the kid to function just to have it for 1 boss....", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "dca0a442d60325537c08000226fca8d3", "ts": "1757494134.174609", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "i mean we should add in the truck with rednex zombie bosses :slightly_smiling_face: or something", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "2842e32225b012dc343638c62c55745a", "ts": "1757494233.553229", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "That would ideally be the case but Leonard said we can't afford it. So I decided to ask you for a consult. We can talk about this more in the art meeting. It's just a question of time and money, really. Otherwise everyone agrees we need new zombies.", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "6c34426d9fbfa5d17383be5cd5c40c3c", "ts": "1757494252.447539", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "estimate on what? on a zombie? like i said. we need to know what modification i need to add and then test it to see for 1 zombie and then i can say for certing. this wont brake things, etc etc. but it might take couple of hours on zombie etc i dont know for sure. depends what we need to do", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": "1757493880.949309", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "d42664eb591f83379478a93e2fde2e31", "ts": "1757494320.440669", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "text": "yes. but i dont think i have the time to work on the zombies now , thats the thing. they set me some priorities and new stuff appears every time that we dont have", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "2d779dfa0be769366ce8d180b01bbab6", "ts": "1757523685.644459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "D05TZ6N1QBH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [{"created": 1757523677, "display_as_bot": false, "editable": false, "external_type": "", "file_access": "visible", "filetype": "png", "has_rich_preview": false, "id": "F09E5FRH771", "is_external": false, "is_public": false, "is_starred": false, "media_display_type": "unknown", "mimetype": "image/png", "mode": "hosted", "name": "image.png", "original_h": 800, "original_w": 1200, "permalink": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/files/EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID/F09E5FRH771/image.png", "permalink_public": "https://slack-files.com/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09E5FRH771-820560f8d8", "pretty_type": "PNG", "public_url_shared": false, "size": 1738110, "skipped_shares": true, "thumb_1024": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09E5FRH771-619c18a87a/image_1024.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_1